Property example_prop_00 "Generally Eventually p2 gets a token" is:
A (G (F (1 <= (#tokens("p2")))))
end.

Property example_prop_01 "Generally p1 has a token" is:
A (G (1 <= (#tokens("p1"))))
end.

Property example_prop_02 "Generally Eventually t1 can be fired" is:
A G F (("t1"?))
end.

Property example_prop_03 "Generally t2 or t3 can be fired" is:
A G ((("t1", "t2", "t3")?))
end.